/-
  `O`-version of the §12-type totally separated design, q = 19, rational twists `t = 222/25 = 8.88` and
  `t = 1777/200 = 8.885` (all three embeddings equal `t`), the 27 rows of degrees 4..12.  `O = Z[θ]`, θ³ + θ² − 6θ − 7 = 0.

  Namespaces `DesignT222over25Cert`, `DesignT1777over200Cert`: an `S₃`-symmetric test polynomial `q ∈ T_t` with
  `q(0) = 0` (orbit coefficients over m0, m100, m110, m111, m200, m210, m211, m220, m221, m222).
    * `q_mem`, `p0_mem`: `q, p0 ∈ T_t` (explicit `Σ_j g(u_j)·h_j`, `g(x) = (x − t)² + 19`), `q_zero`, `p0_zero`.
    * `dq_neg_shift` (outside the box, radius R = 80): after `a₁ = d + 80`, `−Δq` is an explicit sum of
      `c·M·(Σ vᵢ zᵢ)²` (c > 0, M a monomial, at most four terms) plus a polynomial with nonnegative coefficients
      (`ring` + `positivity`).  `dq_neg_of_some_coord_ge` (six coordinates > 0, one of them ≥ 80): `Δq < 0`.
      No norm condition is used.
    * `no_design_of_box_table` (ASSUMPTION `hbox`: every piece with all six coordinates ≤ 80 has `Δq < 0`; positive
      coordinates, nonnegative weights, the design equations for `q` and `p0`): `False`.
      The table `hbox` was checked exactly outside Lean on B_80 (26,948 totally positive elements of `O` with all
      embeddings ≤ 80; 121,752,610 pairs up to the simultaneous Galois action), integer arithmetic (`__int128`).
  The dictionary "design ⟺ `Σ n Δp = p(0)` for all `p ∈ T_t`" (earlier notes, on paper) is not formalised here.
-/
import Mathlib

set_option linter.unusedVariables false
set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option maxRecDepth 100000

namespace DesignT222over25Cert

/-- `g(x) = (x − t)² + 19` (`t = 222/25`); the eight points `(t ± i√19)³` are the common zeros of `g(u₁), g(u₂), g(u₃)`. -/
noncomputable def g (x : ℝ) : ℝ := x^2 - (444/25)*x + (61159/625)

